# The build context is already the allowlisted bundle. This is a second lock: if the context ever held more, these
# are refused by name, so private files cannot be sent to the builder.
**/*.csv
**/*.joblib
**/*.npy
**/*.npz
**/*.ipynb
**/*.pkl
**/tier1
**/artifacts
**/classifier
**/.env*
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.git
**/tests
